{
 "name": "FPM, Part I, Chapter 5, Section B - Temporary Fiduciary Appointments",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&lt;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000223123\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 5, Section A - Supervised Direct Pay (SDP)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000223123?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000223127\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 6, Section A - Fund Usage Review Oversight\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000223127?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p><a id=\"top\" name=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Overview</strong></span></span></a></p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">In This Section</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">This section contains the topic, \u201c<a href=\"#1\">Temporary Fiduciary</a>.\u201d </span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; Temporary Fiduciary</span></span></h2>\n\n<div></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">This topic contains general information on temporary fiduciary appointments, including</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1a\">temporary fiduciaries as limited emergency fiduciaries</a></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1b\">limitations and responsibilities applicable to temporary fiduciary appointments</a>, and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1c\">designating a temporary fiduciary</a>.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">January 5, 2023&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">I.5.B.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; Temporary Fiduciaries as Limited Emergency Fiduciaries</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/38/5507\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C. 5507(d)</a> permits Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) to appoint a temporary fiduciary in limited and emergent situations.</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">The appointment of a temporary fiduciary is reserved for situations where VA determines that the beneficiary has an immediate need for fiduciary services and VA</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">has removed a fiduciary and cannot expedite the appointment of a successor fiduciary, or</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">determines that it would not be in the beneficiary\u2019s or the beneficiary\u2019s dependents\u2019 interest to pay benefits to the beneficiary until a fiduciary is appointed.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong>Reference</strong></em>:&nbsp; For more information on removal of a fiduciary see <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?SID=0f2c1ea018e187d6c8b55ed61182cac3&amp;mc=true&amp;node=se38.1.13_1500&amp;rgn=div8\" target=\"_blank\">38 CFR 13.500</a>.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">I.5.B.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; Limitations and Responsibilities Applicable to Temporary Fiduciary Appointments</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">The following limitations and responsibilities apply to all temporary fiduciary appointments.&nbsp; Temporary fiduciaries</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">may serve no longer than 120 days</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">must serve without a fiduciary fee</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">may receive only the monthly VA benefits needed for the care of the beneficiary and their recognized dependents, with any retroactive funds withheld, and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">must provide an accounting of funds received during the period of the temporary fiduciary appointment.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Certification of one or more temporary fiduciaries may not exceed a total of 120 days under any circumstance.</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Prior to expiration of the 120-day period</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">a fiduciary must be selected based on a VA rating of inability to manage funds or a court-appointed guardianship, or</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">the temporary fiduciary arrangement is terminated, and the beneficiary is paid directly.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong>Reference</strong></em>:&nbsp; For information on fiduciary workflow stage indicators and administrative tasks, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000181738\" articlename=\"Appendix F.  Fiduciary Workflow Stage Indicators, Administrative Tasks, and Workload Management\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000181738?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-4, Appendix F</a>.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">I.5.B.1.c<a id=\"1c\" name=\"1c\">.</a>&nbsp; Designating a Temporary Fiduciary</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Appointment of a temporary fiduciary allows VA to immediately deliver benefits to the beneficiary in temporary and emergent situations.&nbsp; To expeditiously appoint a temporary fiduciary, the Field Examiner (FE) may waive the face-to-face interviews, criminal background inquiry (CBI), and credit check for a temporary fiduciary when the temporary fiduciary</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">has already met the qualification criteria for fiduciary appointment</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">is performing satisfactorily as a fiduciary for at least one other VA beneficiary, and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">has submitted an annual accounting for a beneficiary which VA has approved.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">VA may appoint a temporary fiduciary without consideration of the beneficiary\u2019s preference.</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">The FE must indicate in the field examination the temporary appointment and reason for such.&nbsp; This information will serve as justification for the waiver of the face-to-face interviews, CBI, and credit check in qualifying the temporary fiduciary.</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong>References</strong></em>:&nbsp; For more information on</span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">criteria for deactivating the beneficiary record of a temporary fiduciary, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000153967\" articlename=\"FPM, Part II, Chapter 1, Section D - Managing Beneficiary and Fiduciary Records\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000153967?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">FPM, Part II, 1.D.2.f</a></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">certifying a temporary fiduciary, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000153946\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 1, Section B - General Information on the Fiduciary Program\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000153946?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">FPM, Part I, 1.B.3.d</a>, and</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">oversight and follow-up oversight exceptions for temporary fiduciaries, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000153952\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 2, Section D - Follow-Up Field Examinations\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000153952?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">FPM, Part I, 2.D.1.f</a>.</span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&lt;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000223123\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 5, Section A - Supervised Direct Pay (SDP)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000223123?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000223127\" articlename=\"FPM, Part I, Chapter 6, Section A - Fund Usage Review Oversight\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000223127?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><a href=\"#top\">To Top</a></span></span></p>\n",
